{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2022-10-13 16:17:00', 'title': 'JIM UMPLEBY TO CONTINUE AS CATERPILLAR CHAIRMAN & CEO', 'text': "IRVING, TEXAS , OCT. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS WAIVED THE POLICY REQUIRING CATERPILLAR'S CHAIRMAN AND CEO, JIM UMPLEBY, TO RETIRE AT AGE 65. UMPLEBY HAS AGREED TO REMAIN IN HIS POSITION BEYOND FEBRUARY 2023, WHEN HE TURNS 65."}